{"id": "1552033706653253835", "channel_id": "1400749543288475770", "author_id": "393585313618067456", "author_name": "katesthio", "content": "Technically, Kath and Fauxborn are obtainable now. Two problems thou. \n\nKath is in Chaos and two other Chaos DPS are better(Cetarchon, Mouchette), so it’s not as worth to pick her up. Plus Kath uses similiar Supports as Cetarchon. \n\nFauxborn fills in well as Aequor DPS and uses Aequor Awakeners no other DPS uses. The problem here is Fauxborn wants E3 to enable DPS, and OE to DPS well.\n\nNext trio banner is kinda iffy for a DPS as well. Miryiam is Aequor Support. Castor is Ultra Tank. Xu is the Best Poison Trigger Caro Awakener. In this case, there isn’t exactly a DPS Awakener either unless you play Poison with a E3+ Nymphae.\n\nNext new Limited Awakener is assumed as Oathbound Duo Awakener. Not sure if they will be DPS either.", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T19:07:51.058000+00:00", "type": 19, "mentions": ["539140221275602956"], "reply_to": "1552019127349149847"}
